    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A superb 3 bedroom end-terrace house located in Martello Village comes to the market in excellent condition. This stylish and modern residence extends to c. 100 sq.m. (c. 1,076 sq.ft.) and offers bright living areas in walk in condition. Within minutes walk of Drogheda Town Centre and Drogheda Train Station the property is also surrounded with a wealth of amenities and services including shops, restaurants, schools, and other transport services. This house has all the ingredients for the discerning first time buyer seeking a residential property in the much sought after Dublin Road area of Drogheda Town."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway\r\nLiving Room\t\t(4.50m x 3.51m)\r\nKitchen\t\t(3.26m x 3.77m)\r\nDining\t\t\t(2.51m x 2.32m) \r\nGuest WC\t\t(1.51m x 1.48m)\r\n\r\n1st Floor\r\nLanding\r\nBedroom 1\t\t(3.20m x 2.87m) \r\n\t\t\t(1.77m x 1.53m)\r\nEn Suite \t\t(1.51m x 1.71m)\r\nBedroom 2\t\t(3.31m x 2.43m) \r\nBedroom 3\t\t(2.18m x 2.75m) \r\nMain Bathroom \t(1.80m x 1.67m)"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "3 Bedroom End-Terrace\r\nBuilt C. 2004\r\nExtends to c. 100 sq.m. (c. 1,076 sq.ft.)\r\nPVC Double Glazing\r\nG-F-C-H\r\nGas Fire Optional\r\nWired For Alarm\r\nSouth/East Facing Rear Orientation\r\nPrivate Rear Aspect \r\nRear Garden\r\nAmple Parking"
